# SLAM25 Members Area Project Structure

This is a full-stack Poetry Slam application with a React 19 frontend and Express.js backend using PostgreSQL.

## Core Architecture
- **Frontend**: React 19 + Vite + TailwindCSS + React Router v7
- **Backend**: Express.js + PostgreSQL + Prisma ORM
- **Real-time**: Socket.io for WebSocket connections
- **PWA**: Progressive Web App with service workers

## Key Entry Points
- Frontend: [index.html](mdc:index.html) → [src/main.jsx](mdc:src/main.jsx) → [src/App.jsx](mdc:src/App.jsx)
- Backend: [server/server.js](mdc:server/server.js)
- Database Schema: [prisma/schema.prisma](mdc:prisma/schema.prisma)

## Directory Structure
- `/src/` - React frontend components and services
- `/server/` - Express.js backend API
- `/database/` - SQL migrations and setup scripts
- `/prisma/` - Database schema and migrations
- `/public/` - Static assets and PWA files

## Key Features
- Member dashboard with competition rounds
- Admin panel for content management
- Real-time updates via WebSocket
- City tips and location recommendations
- News and community features
- PWA capabilities with offline support